on beginSprite me
  [  0] getparam 0 .............................. <me>
  [  2] getobjprop 9 ............................ <me.spriteNum>
  [  4] pusharglist 1 ........................... <me.spriteNum>
  [  6] extcall 8 ............................... <sprite(me.spriteNum)>
  [  8] pushint8 51 ............................. <51>
  [ 11] setobjprop 10 ........................... sprite(me.spriteNum).locZ = 51
  [ 13] ret
end
